"},{"content":null,"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0df8e55ea67e07bd016accb8ded36c87d089c8ccf94638ab60","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12fa1-890e-7f90-887f-d6c42cc85d6b"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":null,"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0df8e55ea67e07bd016accb8f2131887d0b925b2d9799dba8e","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12fa1-890e-7f90-887f-d6c42cc85d6b"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"The three-pass report is ready and tested: 805 tests pass, with typecheck and build clean. The comparison costs remain pending, and the separate cap proof is included. I’m publishing the follow-up now; labelled A/B/C paths will let me regenerate it as each pass lands.\n","type":"output_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"retained_source":{"complete":true,"id":{"message_id":"msg_0df8e55ea67e07bd016accb8f21dd487d0812bf1a5b6b4a856","role":"assistant","turn_id":"01a12fa1-890e-7f90-887f-d6c42cc85d6b"},"revision":"retained_01a12fb2-769b-7360-827c-eca8716446c6"},"user_input_order":1614},"id":"msg_0df8e55ea67e07bd016accb8f21dd487d0812bf1a5b6b4a856","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1791801586.1391492,"turn_id":"01a12fa1-890e-7f90-887f-d6c42cc85d6b"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_1e0bd3194f154a3fba2b827acd5a5dfe","id":"ctc_0df8e55ea67e07bd016accb8f379bc87d0b46d25538048ec54","input":"text(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:99784,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1400}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git log -1 --oneline origin/main\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"node scripts/routing-evidence.mjs --help\",max_output_tokens:1200}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791801587.4784281,"turn_id":"01a12fa1-890e-7f90-887f-d6c42cc85d6b"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_1e0bd3194f154a3fba2b827acd5a5dfe","guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000},"id":"ctco_01a12fb2-804a-7fb1-bcc1-0aec67f30e5c","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791801589.834419,"turn_id":"01a12fa1-890e-7f90-887f-d6c42cc85d6b"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.4 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"70fcc4\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.00001475,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":156,\"output\":\"[entire] Pushing 4 checkpoint ref(s) to origin..................... done\\nremote: \\nremote: Create a pull request for 'ao/neatlogs-hack-5/comparison-evidence-input' on GitHub by visiting:        \\nremote:      https://github.com/Vaibhaav-Tiwari/neatlogs-hack/pull/new/ao/neatlogs-hack-5/comparison-evidence-input        \\nremote: \\nTo https://github.com/Vaibhaav-Tiwari/neatlogs-hack.git\\n * [new branch]      ao/neatlogs-hack-5/comparison-evidence-input -\u003e ao/neatlogs-hack-5/comparison-evidence-input\\nbranch 'ao/neatlogs-hack-5/comparison-evidence-input' set up to track 'origin/ao/neatlogs-hack-5/comparison-evidence-input'.\\n\"}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"75424b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.0000055,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":22,\"output\":\"9f18111 Merge pull request #137 from Vaibhaav-Tiwari/codex/neatlogs-post-worker-drain\\n\"}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"fa688c\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000005042,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":78,\"output\":\"Usage: npm run build, then node scripts/routing-evidence.mjs [--manifest runs.json] [--comparison-dir \u003cfolder\u003e] --out \u003cdirectory\u003e [--issues issues.json] [--live-traces]\\nManifest: an audited JSON array of real run directories. Without --live-traces the cached trace-readback.json is replayed with no API calls.\\n\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"content":null,"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0df8e55ea67e07bd016accb8ffe40087d092dc0fa03f314907","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12fa1-890e-7f90-887f-d6c42cc85d6b"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_64232333fae24ae4ae351d2471921caa","id":"ctc_0df8e55ea67e07bd016accb9000b7887d0bf6eda8321190512","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"gh pr create --base main --head ao/neatlogs-hack-5/comparison-evidence-input --title 'Report matched baseline, prior and trace-history comparison passes' --body '## Summary\\n- Adds --comparison-dir for measured plan signals and explicit A/B/C run-path assignments (optional --comparison-passes JSON elsewhere keeps source signals read-only).\\n- Exactly A top-tier baseline, B Tally v1/priors, C Tally v2/trace-history: task-level cost/verdict/attempts, pass-level cost/pass rate/attempts, three SVG charts and per-pass size-cost correlations.\\n- Joins only at the exact pinned base SHA and recorded task text; unknown/wrong pass, missing base/text, dry/active runs are excluded. Missing passes/tasks remain pending; skipped/interrupted results retain denominators.\\n- Raw decision provenance remains in CSV/JSON. Observed routing statistics need not imply a learned P90 cap; C label alone is not proof history changed every decision.\\n- Records actual capped-stop/escalation evidence separately from the benchmark.\\n\\n## Validation\\n805 tests pass on main 9f18111, typecheck/build clean. Fake tests cover missing data, base/text mismatches, A/B/C isolation, simulated/active exclusion, duplicates and skipped outcomes. Three charts visually checked via AO; no console errors. Cached regeneration makes no API calls.\\n\\n## Live read-only evidence\\nReal cap retry run-20261012-100856Z: cheap stopped at $0.01956044 against $0.018 cap, middle passed at $0.16957640; total $0.18913684. Fresh readback verifies both stored worker traces (12/12 across audited runs), 6 history-cost matches. Failure classification stays ceiling/ledger; trace delivery does not retroactively make it trace-derived.\\n\\n## Limits / next data\\nA/B/C costs currently pending; no invented savings or paid comparison results. Awaiting lane A paths. Plan: five tasks at base 565e6ccd757ff794ead643dac7359efe67ec9db2, BENCH-1 dependents/graph unmeasured; single repo/repeat, repeated tasks not independent, model pricing/setup/caching confounded. Cost remains list-price/AO estimate, not invoice. No paid workers or cfo.ai writes.\\nReport: /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/report.md' \",sandbox_permissions:\"require_escalated\",justification:\"Open the authorized small comparison-report follow-up PR with honest pending-data and verified cap evidence.\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1500}));\nconst r=await tools.mcp__ao__html_preview({html:'\u003c!doctype html\u003e\u003chtml\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cstyle\u003ebody{margin:0}img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}\u003c/style\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/cost-by-routing.svg\" alt=\"Cost per comparison task\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/success-by-routing.svg\" alt=\"Three-pass success\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-5/routing-evidence/size-cost.svg\" alt=\"Size versus real cost\"\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e',width:960});\nfor(const c of r.content??[]) {if(c.type===\"image\")image(c); else if(c.type===\"text\")text(c.text);}\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791801600.0622995,"turn_id":"01a12fa1-890e-7f90-887f-d6c42cc85d6b"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_64232333fae24ae4ae351d2471921caa","guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000},"id":"ctco_01a12fb3-0c8d-7103-9827-4dd0cc159b77","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791801