,\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000004791,\"exit_code\":1,\"original_token_count\":181,\"output\":\"Preparing worktree (new branch 'worker-proof')\\n ❯ cli/dashboard-server.test.ts (1 test | 1 failed) 42ms\\n   ❯ dashboard server (1)\\n     × serves dashboard files and run data without directory listing or traversal 10ms\\n\\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯ Failed Tests 1 ⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\\n\\n FAIL  cli/dashboard-server.test.ts > dashboard server > serves dashboard files and run data without directory listing or traversal\\nError: listen EPERM: operation not permitted 127.0.0.1\\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[1/1]⎯\\n\\n\\n Test Files  1 failed | 64 passed (65)\\n      Tests  1 failed | 815 passed (816)\\n   Start at  16:29:59\\n   Duration  11.40s (tests 82%, import 11%, transform 5%, setup 1%)\\n\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"7ba1ad\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000005291,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1202,\"output\":\"# Routing evidence\\n\\nGenerated 2026-10-12T11:00:15.905Z. 22 closed real runs; 29 task outcomes (including skipped).\\n\\n## Three-Pass Comparison\\n\\nPlan measured 2026-10-12T09:30:21.074Z, pinned base 565e6ccd757ff794ead643dac7359efe67ec9db2. Signals source: /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/artifacts/neatlogs-hack-2/mentor-comparison-plan-signals.json.\\n\\n| Pass | Covered tasks | Task outcomes | Mean cost/task USD | Pass rate | Model attempts | Startup retries |\\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\\n| A: top-tier baseline | 3/5 | 3 | 0.40565 | 100.0% | 3 | 3 |\\n| B: Tally v1 (priors) | 0/5 | 0 | pending | pending | pending | pending |\\n| C: Tally v2 (trace history) | 0/5 | 0 | pending | pending | pending | pending |\\n\\nStartup retries are zero-token error rows with an explicit linked :startup-retry row, not model failures or model attempts-to-success; all recorded costs remain included. Zero-token errors without that link remain operational errors.\\n\\n| Task | Size | Targets | Dependents | Graph nodes | Text chars | Named paths | A: cost/verdict/attempts | B: cost/verdict/attempts | C: cost/verdict/attempts |\\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|---|---|\\n| BENCH-1 | small | 1 | unmeasured | unmeasured | 634 | 3 | pending | pending | pending |\\n| BENCH-2 | small | 2 | 26 | 12 | 746 | 2 | $0.45790 / passed / 1 model attempts + 1 startup retries (run-20261012T104159Z-comparison-A) | pending | pending |\\n| BENCH-3 | medium | 4 | 70 | 23 | 869 | 3 | pending | pending | pending |\\n| BENCH-4 | medium | 3 | 35 | 21 | 803 | 3 | $0.41609 / passed / 1 model attempts + 1 startup retries (run-20261012T104159Z-comparison-A) | pending | pending |\\n| BENCH-5 | large | 3 | 91 | 21 | 1110 | 4 | $0.34294 / passed / 1 model attempts + 1 startup retries (run-20261012T104159Z-comparison-A) | pending | pending |\\n\\n![Cost per comparison task](cost-by-routing.svg)\\n\\n![Pass rate per comparison pass](success-by-routing.svg)\\n\\nPass labels are explicit experiment assignments, not proof that history affected every route in C. Actual routing provenance remains in tasks.csv. Costs only come from matching real ledgers; plan signals never supply spend. Missing passes/tasks stay pending; partial coverage is not a completed comparison. No savings claim before all three passes cover the same tasks. A single repeat establishes no statistical spread.\\n\\nComparison join exclusions: 0 (base/text/pass-label mismatches retained in results.json).\\n\\n## Historical Audit (Not the Matched Comparison)\\n\\n| Routing evidence | Task outcomes | Passed | Operational errors | Skipped | Mean cost (USD) | Pass rate |\\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\\n| prior-only | 11 | 7 | 4 | 0 | 0.08574 | 63.6% |\\n| trace-driven | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | not measured | not measured |\\n| local-history | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | not measured | not measured |\\n| unattributed | 15 | 9 | 4 | 0 | 0.03240 | 60.0% |\\n| baseline | 3 | 3 | 0 | 0 | 0.40565 | 100.0% |\\n\\nPrior-only requires an explicit prior statement for the chosen tier. Trace-driven requires explicit neatlogs provenance and observed statistics for the chosen tier; this can affect routing before five successful cost samples exist for a learned P90 cap. A configured cap is not a learned cap. Old ambiguous decisions are unattributed, not silently assigned to either group.\\n\\nNo v1/v2 savings claim or baseline comparison is valid until both have measured, matched tasks. Missing cohorts mean not measured, never zero cost or 0% success. Closed interrupted runs and skipped tasks stay in the denominator; zero spend on an unstarted task is not savings. Repeated issues across runs are not independent experiments.\\n\\n## Does sizing predict cost?\\n\\n| Signal | Paired successful tasks | Pearson r | Spearman rho | Interpretation |\\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\\n| Entire graph nodes | 3 | -0.778 | -0.866 | Negative association in this sample, not a causal or out-of-sample prediction. |\\n| Predicted target files | 3 | -0.778 | -0.866 | Negative association in this sample, not a causal or out-of-sample prediction. |\\n| Issue-text characters | 3 | -0.976 | -1.000 | Negative association in this sample, not a causal or out-of-sample prediction. |\\n| Path-like file mentions | 3 | -0.988 | -1.000 | Negative association in this sample, not a causal or out-of-sample prediction. |\\n\\n| Pass | Signal | Successful pairs | Pearson r | Spearman rho |\\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|\\n| A | Entire graph nodes | 3 | -0.778 | -0.866 |\\n| A | Predicted target files | 3 | -0.778 | -0.866 |\\n| A | Issue-text characters | 3 | -0.976 | -1.000 |\\n| A | Path-like file mentions | 3 | -0.988 | -1.000 |\\n| B | Entire graph nodes | 0 | not measured | not measured |\\n| B | Predicted target files | 0 | not measured | not measured |\\n| B | Issue-text characters | 0 | not measured | not measured |\\n| B | Path-like file mentions | 0 | not measured | not measured |\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12fc0-e6ed-70d3-9280-cf68527cb68a","create_time":1791802816.223833}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
